# Baseline for scripts/go-fortest-liveness-census.sh (#17342): *ForTest* hooks
# in non-test Go code that nothing calls, each with the reason it stays.
# Format: <name>\t<file>\t<reason>. The census fails on a row whose hook gained
# a caller or was deleted, so this list cannot outlive its entries.
AttachRecvFnForTest	pkg/linuxsock/ppoll.go	it is the only setter of the recvFn field that PpollRecv.Recv branches on (#17231); deleting it orphans that product-code branch, so it goes with a product change, not a test-seam cleanup
